 fear, anger, happiness, surprise, or shame. Seen as cute, as part of humorous comedy. The character's face suddenly turns into a simplified version, the body will usually also deform into that of a small child (oversized head, short limbs, extra-large tears).","totalMediaCount":301,"slug":"super-deformed","nsfw":false,"childCount":0},"relationships":{"parent":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/72/relationships/parent","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/72/parent"}},"anime":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/72/relationships/anime","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/72/anime"}},"drama":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/72/relationships/drama","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/72/drama"}},"manga":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/72/relationships/manga","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/72/manga"}}}},{"id":"160","type":"categories","links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/160"},"attributes":{"createdAt":"2017-05-31T06:39:23.938Z","updatedAt":"2021-10-02T01:30:59.176Z","title":"Comedy","description":"Anime whose central struggle causes hilarious results. These stories are built upon funny characters, situations and events. A comedy anime is laced with humour and sets out to provoke laughter from the audience.\n\nJapanese humour can be a bit strange to westerners, so if you're new to this type of humour, just bear with it; it'll most likely grow on you if you're a fan of other kinds of comedy.","totalMediaCount":25974,"slug":"comedy","nsfw":false,"childCount":6},"relationships":{"parent":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/160/relationships/parent","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/160/parent"}},"anime":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/160/relationships/anime","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/160/anime"}},"drama":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/ed